        <item>
            <title>1.3.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:38:18 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://macaway.app</link>
            <sparkle:version>369</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li><b>Watch it unlock.</b> With Caffeine mode on, the screen now stays on behind the lock, so as you walk back you can see MacAway type your password.</li>
  <li><b>Keep just your Mac awake.</b> Untick Keep screen on in the Caffeine mode menu, and the screen turns off and locks as usual while your Mac stays awake.</li>
  <li><b>Time left.</b> Caffeine mode now shows when it ends and how much time is left.</li>
  <li><b>Choose when it unlocks.</b> A new slider under Advanced sets how close you need to be before MacAway unlocks your Mac.</li>
  <li><b>Quicker and more careful.</b> Unlocking reacts a little sooner when you come back, and waits for more than one reading before it decides.</li>
  <li><b>Fixes.</b> Keeping a menu open no longer interrupts measuring. A new mode starts from the standard settings.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
